1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,500
KOCHIKAME - TOKYO BEAT COPS

2
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:18,200
♪ Aiming toward the sunset floating on the Nakagawa River ♪

3
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:24,500
♪ I kicked a pebble, and my shoe flew off with it ♪

4
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:29,800
♪ It hit someone out jogging right on their back ♪

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,500
♪ I bowed my head and apologized: 'Sorry about that!' ♪

6
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:47,000
♪ Even when I've lost my cheerful spirit somewhere ♪

7
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:53,500
♪ The familiar, unchanging townscape is strangely kind ♪

8
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:06,800
♪ From east to west, the sun sets ♪

9
00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:15,400
♪ And another day quietly draws to a close ♪

10
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:23,500
♪ Katsushika Rhapsody ♪

11
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:29,500
Episode 51: Profit from the Haunted House!

12
00:01:31,700 --> 00:02:01,360
I wonder if kids these days have zero interest in haunted houses.

13
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:10,900
Well, that's obvious. Kids today are used to insane Hollywood SFX.
If you show them a one-eyed boy or a faceless ghost, they'll just laugh.

14
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:13,960
What the heck is this 'SF-whatever'?

15
00:02:14,340 --> 00:02:16,780
Special effects. You know, state-of-the-art movie tech!

16
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:20,580
Hey, Ryo-san! Don't spit your watermelon seeds over here!

17
00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:27,920
Still, back when we were kids, we used to really look forward
to haunted houses and tests of courage!

18
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:32,300
Yeah... I guess this annual shopping street tradition is dying out, too.

19
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:34,360
It does feel a bit lonely.

20
00:02:34,820 --> 00:02:39,240
Bottom line is, we just need gimmicks that today's kids will actually love!

21
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,000
Do you have something in mind?

22
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:43,540
Leave it to me! Nothing is impossible for Kankichi Ryotsu!

23
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:48,840
How about this? Give me 10% of the food stall sales,
and I'll run the whole show!

24
00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:49,460
You idiot!

25
00:02:49,700 --> 00:02:51,260
Ow, ow, ow! That hurts, you bastard!

26
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:52,360
Chief!

27
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:57,740
You insolent fool! Asking for a cut when cooperating with citizens?!

28
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:58,440
You moron!

29
00:02:59,040 --> 00:02:59,420
Hey!

30
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,640
Chief! Where did you get that shinai?!

31
00:03:01,740 --> 00:03:05,320
I just bought it at the sporting goods store specifically
to discipline troublesome subordinates!

32
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,920
Yeah, yeah, yeah...

33
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:12,960
Our duty as police officers is to serve our citizens for free!

34
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,780
Do you understand, Ryotsu?!

35
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,880
Yes sir, loud and clear, sir!

36
00:03:21,380 --> 00:03:24,980
Dammit... working for free in this blistering heat is ridiculous!

37
00:03:25,220 --> 00:03:28,520
Besides, no way modern kids will be scared of a one-eyed boy.

38
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,160
Don't worry, just leave it to us!

39
00:03:30,580 --> 00:03:30,820
That's right!

40
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,160
I've got complete confidence in this!

41
00:03:32,780 --> 00:03:38,360
I ordered the latest special FX makeup supplies from Hollywood.
It will look shockingly realistic!

42
00:03:38,940 --> 00:03:40,120
Alright, let's begin!

43
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:41,740
Yeah, yeah, do whatever you want.

44
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:48,630
Here's what you'll need: plaster, silicone, and a bit of foam latex.

45
00:03:49,090 --> 00:03:50,230
Now, let's get making!

46
00:03:51,210 --> 00:03:53,790
First, apply silicone to the face to take a mold.

47
00:03:55,040 --> 00:04:00,520
Next, cast a plaster bust from the mold, and sculpt
the one-eyed monster face on top using clay.

48
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:00,580
Right.

49
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:10,010
Take a plaster mold, discard the clay, and whip the foam latex
until it's completely smooth and even.

50
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:16,780
Pour the foam latex evenly into the mold,
then bake it thoroughly in the oven.

51
00:04:17,220 --> 00:04:19,120
Feels like we're baking a cake...

52
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,300
Open the mold, and there you have it!

53
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:24,900
All that's left is adhering it with glue and painting it!

54
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:28,460
It's super easy, so everyone should try this at home!

55
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:29,980
All done!

56
00:04:30,420 --> 00:04:32,660
Wow, that turned out amazingly realistic!

57
00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:33,160
Sure did.

58
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:36,140
Alright! Let's test it out by scaring the Chief!

59
00:04:44,020 --> 00:04:45,400
I'm back...

60
00:04:52,470 --> 00:04:53,970
Who... WHO ARE YOU?!

61
00:04:55,850 --> 00:05:08,320
Please Chief, stop! It's me!

62
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:10,680
It's your beloved subordinate, Ryotsu!

63
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:11,700
You can't fool me!

64
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:14,880
Chief, that really is Ryo-chan!

65
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:17,280
Reiko-san gave him special FX makeup!

66
00:05:17,340 --> 00:05:18,700
No way... I can't believe it!

67
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:19,440
Is it really you?

68
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:21,540
Just watch this.

69
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:23,940
Oh, look! Down there!

70
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,120
What? Hey, it's a 5-yen coin!

71
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,380
Well, free money is free money! Finders keepers!

72
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:29,740
Yep, that's definitely Ryotsu.

73
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:32,340
See?! I told you it was me!

74
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:34,280
My head is spinning...

75
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:35,900
What on earth is the meaning of this disguise?!

76
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:38,840
I'm participating in tonight's haunted house event!

77
00:05:39,260 --> 00:05:43,100
I didn't even want to do it, but I went through all this
trouble just to help out!

78
00:05:43,180 --> 00:05:45,900
Don't bring your face so close! It's revolting!

79
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:48,000
Senpai, we need to head to the venue soon.

80
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,560
Is it that time already?

81
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,920
Are you really going out dressed like that?!

82
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,160
I'll give you a ride in my car.

83
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:54,340
Yeah, thanks. If I walked like this, it'd cause a public panic!

84
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,420
That would be a disaster.

85
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:59,060
Terai! Hey, Terai, are you okay?!

86
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:04,390
Did he pass out, Terai?

87
00:06:07,450 --> 00:06:09,350
Ryo-chan, hurry up and go!

88
00:06:09,750 --> 00:06:09,950
Huh?

89
00:06:10,850 --> 00:06:19,420
Look! Look at that!

90
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:21,520
It's Nakagawa-san's Ferrari!

91
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:22,220
Really?!

92
00:06:23,250 --> 00:06:24,810
Talk about super lucky!

93
00:06:25,670 --> 00:06:27,790
Let's ask him to take us for a drive!

94
00:06:28,030 --> 00:06:28,330
Yeah!

95
00:06:28,570 --> 00:06:29,510
Let's do that!

96
00:06:35,660 --> 00:06:38,880
Wow, it's gorgeous!

97
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:43,820
That'll be 1,325 yen.

98
00:06:58,630 --> 00:07:00,950
Senpai, please stop fooling around!

99
00:07:01,110 --> 00:07:02,950
They called out to me first, so I just answered!

100
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:04,290
Just answered?!

101
00:07:04,630 --> 00:07:05,330
I'll be right back.

102
00:07:05,450 --> 00:07:06,510
Please wait a moment.

103
00:07:06,610 --> 00:07:07,730
Yeah, yeah, sure.

104
00:07:07,830 --> 00:07:09,070
I'm gonna take a nap till we arrive.

105
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:24,320
Man, I never dreamed we'd snag a Ferrari!

106
00:07:24,620 --> 00:07:26,200
We can flip this baby for serious cash!

107
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:32,420
Huh? Was that a groan? Must be hearing things.

108
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:37,100
Man, Nakagawa's driving got awfully reckless...

109
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,260
What was that just now?!

110
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:56,180
I saw something weird in the rearview mirror!

111
00:07:56,540 --> 00:07:58,940
Ow-ow-ow... What's going on?

112
00:08:02,740 --> 00:08:04,540
Who... WHO ARE YOU?!

113
00:08:04,740 --> 00:08:08,620
What?

114
00:08:09,770 --> 00:08:12,090
Wait, are you those car thieves from the news?!

115
00:08:12,650 --> 00:08:14,770
Hey! You car thieves!

116
00:08:14,970 --> 00:08:16,190
You're not getting away!

117
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:18,490
Get back here!

118
00:08:19,810 --> 00:08:24,170
Stop right there!

119
00:08:24,170 --> 00:08:25,170
Help us! Somebody help!

120
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:29,180
Help us, officer! Please arrest us!

121
00:08:29,640 --> 00:08:30,180
Arrest them!

122
00:08:30,180 --> 00:08:31,180
[Tackled by police dog unit]

123
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:31,680
[Police sirens wailing]

124
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,180
Huh?

125
00:08:39,300 --> 00:08:41,520
Ugh... damn it all!

126
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:45,520
Those canine patrol cops stole all my credit!

127
00:08:47,260 --> 00:08:49,880
Shoot, I gotta hurry or the haunted house will start without me!

128
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,000
Oh, perfect! A taxi!

129
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,760
Hey! Taxi, stop!

130
00:08:54,660 --> 00:08:56,240
Phew, made it just in time.

131
00:08:58,830 --> 00:09:00,970
Let's see, do I have any loose change?

132
00:09:01,370 --> 00:09:03,370
Huh? What's his problem?

133
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:18,560
Running off like he just saw a ghost...

134
00:09:18,860 --> 00:09:19,480
Oh, right!

135
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,320
I forgot...

136
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:23,240
I'm still wearing this ultra-realistic monster makeup!

137
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:27,210
If I cause a panic in town, the Chief will beat me to a pulp!

138
00:09:27,210 --> 00:09:31,450
[Sirens approaching]

139
00:09:31,450 --> 00:09:43,100
Crap!

140
00:09:43,100 --> 00:09:52,560
If they catch me looking like this, I'm done for!

141
00:10:50,130 --> 00:10:52,210
Phew... managed to shake them off somehow.

142
00:10:52,210 --> 00:10:55,550
Now then, what am I gonna do?

143
00:10:55,550 --> 00:11:02,200
Another taxi? Guess I've got no choice.

144
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,920
I'll take a gamble and hail one!

145
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:12,120
Driver, please don't freak out!

146
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,760
Yes? How may I help you?

147
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:16,700
See? If you look closely, you can tell it's just makeup!

148
00:11:16,700 --> 00:11:18,880
Everyone's making such a fuss, it's a real pain.

149
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:22,860
Man, what a relief! Glad I got an understanding driver!

150
00:11:22,860 --> 00:11:24,100
Where to, sir?

151
00:11:24,100 --> 00:11:26,060
Take me to Manpuku Temple, please!

152
00:11:26,060 --> 00:11:47,440
Man, I'm running really late.

153
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:50,320
It's awfully dead quiet around here...

154
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:52,560
Did the event finish already?

155
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,360
Hey, what's with that taxi?!

156
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:56,760
He sped off before I even paid the fare!

157
00:11:56,760 --> 00:12:02,060
Well, fine by me—free ride for Ryo-san!

158
00:12:02,060 --> 00:12:05,360
It's pitch black, I can barely see my feet.

159
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:10,290
Whoever's holding that lantern, thanks for being thoughtful!

160
00:12:10,290 --> 00:12:14,400
Sorry I'm late, everyone! My bad, my bad!

161
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:15,480
Who might you be?

162
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:17,580
Oh, the old lady from the candy store?

163
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:20,520
With makeup that thick, no wonder you can barely see!

164
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:26,280
Your arms should be positioned a bit more like this!

165
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:27,240
Like this, maybe?

166
00:12:31,760 --> 00:12:51,440
You're participating in the event too?

167
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,920
No wonder!

168
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:53,980
Whoa...

169
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:54,020
Look at that!

170
00:12:54,020 --> 00:12:54,040
Incredible!

171
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:58,040
Whoa, look at that! Everyone's got insane makeup!

172
00:12:58,040 --> 00:13:01,100
Hard to believe this is just a shopping street festival!

173
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:05,280
Alright, I'll hide over on that side! Let's scare the pants off these kids!

174
00:13:05,280 --> 00:13:08,730
Just watch, I'll make 'em wet themselves!

175
00:13:08,730 --> 00:13:09,890
Just you wait and see!

176
00:13:09,890 --> 00:13:27,340
Where were you all of last night?!

177
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:29,540
That's my line, Chief!

178
00:13:29,540 --> 00:13:33,410
I was waiting at Manpuku Temple the entire night!

179
00:13:33,410 --> 00:13:35,870
Not a single customer showed up!

180
00:13:35,870 --> 00:13:36,470
Huh?

181
00:13:36,470 --> 00:13:39,130
Manpuku Temple, you say?!

182
00:13:39,130 --> 00:13:43,830
Ryo-chan, the test of courage wasn't at Manpuku Temple,
it was at Bunpuku Temple!

183
00:13:43,830 --> 00:13:46,140
What?! You're kidding!

184
00:13:46,140 --> 00:13:47,980
We're not kidding!

185
00:13:47,980 --> 00:13:50,540
Look, it's written right here on the flyer!

186
00:13:50,540 --> 00:13:52,820
It really is...

187
00:13:52,820 --> 00:13:56,260
Wait, but I met the other ghost performers there!

188
00:13:56,260 --> 00:13:59,740
Manpuku Temple is an abandoned ruin! Nobody should be there!

189
00:13:59,740 --> 00:14:02,380
Then... who was it that I met?!

190
00:14:02,660 --> 00:14:06,180
Don't tell me you're claiming you met real ghosts?!

191
00:14:06,180 --> 00:14:08,830
Come to think of it...

192
00:14:08,830 --> 00:14:09,170
Those ghosts...

193
00:14:09,170 --> 00:14:11,670
They were way too realistic for the local merchants!

194
00:14:11,670 --> 00:14:12,550
No way...

195
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:15,670
In this modern scientific age, ghosts don't exist!

196
00:14:15,670 --> 00:14:17,290
Cut the crap, Ryotsu!

197
00:14:17,290 --> 00:14:19,490
You probably slacked off, got late,

198
00:14:19,490 --> 00:14:21,910
and made up this clumsy excuse to cover it up!

199
00:14:21,910 --> 00:14:22,550
Ah...

200
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:25,610
Speaking of which, there was a ghost panic in town last night.

201
00:14:25,610 --> 00:14:28,710
That wouldn't happen to be your doing, would it?!

202
00:14:28,710 --> 00:14:29,570
No!

203
00:14:29,570 --> 00:14:30,730
Absolutely not!

204
00:14:30,730 --> 00:14:33,650
I swear on my badge, my story is 100% true!

205
00:14:33,650 --> 00:14:35,870
Stop talking in your sleep!

206
00:14:35,870 --> 00:14:37,810
Ghosts don't exist!

207
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:39,150
If real ghosts actually existed...

208
00:14:39,170 --> 00:14:42,310
I'd gladly pay cold hard cash to see them!

209
00:14:42,310 --> 00:14:43,910
Wait... is that so?!

210
00:14:43,910 --> 00:14:46,270
If I exploit those real ghosts...!

211
00:14:46,270 --> 00:14:48,620
Step right up! Welcome, welcome!

212
00:14:48,620 --> 00:14:50,220
120% pure terror!

213
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:52,420
Every single ghost is 100% genuine! You can even shake hands!

214
00:14:52,420 --> 00:14:54,520
It'll be the talk of the town for generations!

215
00:14:54,520 --> 00:15:02,880
Plus 'Ghost Purikura' photo booths where you take photos with real spirits!

216
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:05,420
And 'Obaketchi' virtual pets where you raise your own ghost!

217
00:15:05,420 --> 00:15:09,970
And a giant leisure theme park...

218
00:15:09,970 --> 00:15:13,240
where you can play with real ghosts!

219
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,500
Hehehehehe!

220
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:14,600
If I use those ghosts...

221
00:15:15,020 --> 00:15:17,060
I'll become a multi-billionaire, no doubt about it!

222
00:15:17,060 --> 00:15:25,720
I'll make back thousands of times what the Chief made me lose!

223
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:36,160
Now's my chance!

224
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:45,400
Hey! You're the ghost! Don't look at my face and scream!

225
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:48,620
It's me! The one-eyed monster from yesterday!

226
00:15:48,620 --> 00:15:49,480
Wait...

227
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:52,900
Yesterday was just special FX makeup! Look, see?

228
00:15:52,900 --> 00:15:57,200
Hey, everyone! Come on out!

229
00:15:57,200 --> 00:16:03,290
So... you were actually a human being?!

230
00:16:03,290 --> 00:16:07,030
Aw man, we totally thought you were one of us!

231
00:16:07,030 --> 00:16:08,910
Stop whining!

232
00:16:08,910 --> 00:16:12,970
Why are you moping around here, especially when you're real ghosts?!

233
00:16:12,970 --> 00:16:16,550
If you're bored, go into town and haunt some people!

234
00:16:16,550 --> 00:16:20,750
Well, you see... nowadays everywhere is brightly lit even late at night.

235
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:25,890
People are glued to cell phones and games.
Even if we stand right behind them, they don't care!

236
00:16:25,890 --> 00:16:27,670
Modern folks have too many distractions!

237
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:29,750
Our scaring business is completely ruined!

238
00:16:29,790 --> 00:16:35,580
It's so depressing, you know?

239
00:16:35,580 --> 00:16:40,020
Pathetic! It's the end of the world! You call yourselves ghosts?!

240
00:16:40,020 --> 00:16:45,960
A ghost's whole worth comes from terrifying people!

241
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:51,260
Alright! From now on, I will put you through boot camp
so you can be proud ghouls!

242
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:55,800
Got it?! Any complaints?! / None, sir!

243
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:58,040
Very good!

244
00:16:58,040 --> 00:17:00,140
My head is spinning...

245
00:17:00,140 --> 00:17:01,140
Mine too...

246
00:17:01,140 --> 00:17:02,780
Hold your forms!

247
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:03,460
[Groaning under strain]

248
00:17:03,460 --> 00:17:20,420
[Screaming through workout]

249
00:17:21,660 --> 00:17:31,320
Ow, that hurts!

250
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:34,980
You can't hit the target with arrows like that!

251
00:17:34,980 --> 00:17:38,700
Yes, sir!

252
00:17:38,700 --> 00:17:42,480
Faster! Move those ghostly legs!

253
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:45,200
Hey!

254
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:48,270
Are you mocking me?! Put some spine into it!

255
00:17:48,270 --> 00:17:49,130
Brutal...

256
00:18:36,270 --> 00:18:41,690
You thought this would be easy?! Next up: 500 rabbit hops! Let's go!

257
00:18:41,690 --> 00:18:54,600
Tomorrow is opening night! Multi-billionaire status is right in front of me!

258
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:58,120
Ryo-chan... Ryo-chan? / Hm?

259
00:18:58,120 --> 00:19:04,280
What happened to you?! Your face is completely pale! Are you sick?

260
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:14,160
Really? My body feels fine to me. / You look awfully gaunt!
Look, you haven't even eaten half of your pork cutlet bowl!

261
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:21,800
Normally, you'd eat that plus ramen and yakisoba!
Sometimes you even add a tempura bowl and soba!

262
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:27,840
Nah, I just don't have much appetite. It's boiling hot every day, that's all.

263
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:45,660
We should consult the Chief about this... / Yeah, let's do that.

264
00:19:45,660 --> 00:19:46,200
I'm off!

265
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:52,620
Let's follow him! / Tomorrow is opening day!

266
00:19:52,620 --> 00:20:02,120
I want to see the results of your training! Today is our final rehearsal, so it'll be extra strict!
Wait... those are real ghosts!

267
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:07,740
What Ryo-chan said was actually true!
Senpai is being possessed by evil spirits!

268
00:20:07,740 --> 00:20:13,400
At this rate, they might drain his life away! Chief, what should we do?!

269
00:20:19,350 --> 00:20:23,070
What?! I'm possessed by ghosts?!

270
00:20:23,170 --> 00:20:26,670
Indeed! The shadow of death is already written across your face!

271
00:20:26,670 --> 00:20:27,270
Shadow of death?!

272
00:20:27,270 --> 00:20:31,970
If you go back to those ghosts tonight, you will surely be possessed and killed!

273
00:20:31,970 --> 00:20:35,450
Crap! If my scheme gets exposed now, all my investment goes down the drain!

274
00:20:35,450 --> 00:20:39,150
Why would I listen to a shady priest like you?!

275
00:20:39,150 --> 00:20:40,110
Silence, fool!

276
00:20:40,110 --> 00:20:44,950
Our temple possesses sacred exorcism rites passed down for generations!

277
00:20:44,950 --> 00:20:46,710
Listen to him, Ryotsu! It's for your own good!

278
00:20:46,710 --> 00:20:48,630
We're doing this for you!

279
00:20:48,630 --> 00:20:52,710
Even if you hate it, we cannot stand by and watch you die!

280
00:20:52,710 --> 00:20:53,150
[Temple bell tolling]

281
00:21:06,750 --> 00:21:08,300
[Bell tolling rhythmically]

282
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:17,400
Cut it out! Stop!

283
00:21:18,430 --> 00:21:19,430
Be quiet!

284
00:21:19,430 --> 00:21:22,430
I cannot write sacred warding kanji without intense concentration!

285
00:21:22,430 --> 00:21:23,430
Let's see...

286
00:21:25,740 --> 00:21:26,740
Don't look up the kanji in a dictionary!

287
00:21:28,060 --> 00:21:30,060
Namu Amida Butsu... Gachon, gachon!

288
00:21:30,060 --> 00:21:32,060
Nanban tayu, nanban tayu...

289
00:21:32,060 --> 00:21:34,060
Gachon, gachon!

290
00:21:34,060 --> 00:21:37,060
Eloim, Essaim... Fulfill our pact! Gachon, gachon!

291
00:21:37,060 --> 00:21:40,060
Great kanji contemplation! Gachon, gachon!

292
00:21:40,060 --> 00:21:42,060
Gachon, gachon!

293
00:21:42,060 --> 00:21:45,060
Tribe extinction! Gachon, gachon!

294
00:21:45,060 --> 00:21:48,060
Evil spirits begone! Evil spirits begone!

295
00:21:48,060 --> 00:21:51,060
Purify this vessel! Cleanse this soul!

296
00:21:51,060 --> 00:21:54,060
Purify and cleanse!

297
00:21:54,060 --> 00:21:55,060
Gachon, gachon!

298
00:21:55,060 --> 00:21:57,060
Nohara horohirehare...

299
00:21:57,060 --> 00:21:59,060
Janwachonwa no kuekue...

300
00:21:59,060 --> 00:22:01,060
And while we're at it...

301
00:22:01,060 --> 00:22:04,060
Sheeeh! Sheeeh! Sheeeh! Sheeeh!

302
00:22:06,660 --> 00:22:09,660
Evil spirits begone! Evil spirits begone!

303
00:22:09,660 --> 00:22:13,660
In the name of the Moon, I will punish you!

304
00:22:13,660 --> 00:22:15,660
Bear with it, Ryotsu!

305
00:22:15,660 --> 00:22:16,660
Endure the pain!

306
00:22:16,660 --> 00:22:19,660
Gachon! Evil spirits begone! Evil spirits begone!

307
00:22:19,660 --> 00:22:21,660
In the name of the Moon, I will punish you!

308
00:22:21,660 --> 00:22:23,660
Gachon, gachon!

309
00:22:23,660 --> 00:22:25,660
Nohara horohirehare...

310
00:22:25,660 --> 00:22:29,660
Janwachonwa no kuekue...

311
00:22:29,660 --> 00:22:31,660
Gachon, gachon!

312
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:43,250
Evil spirits begone!

313
00:22:43,250 --> 00:22:46,250
Gachon, gachon!

314
00:22:46,250 --> 00:22:47,250
Like hell I'm staying here!

315
00:22:47,250 --> 00:22:49,250
I took out massive loans to fund that haunted house!

316
00:22:50,250 --> 00:23:03,980
Hey, guys! Did you come to rescue me?!

317
00:23:04,980 --> 00:23:05,980
Alright, alright, alright!

318
00:23:07,980 --> 00:23:09,560
Senpai!

319
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:10,560
Ryotsu!

320
00:23:10,560 --> 00:23:11,560
Ryo-chan, come back!

321
00:23:11,560 --> 00:23:12,560
Alright! Let's rush straight to the venue!

322
00:23:14,560 --> 00:23:16,520
Please save us!

323
00:23:17,520 --> 00:23:18,520
That man is terrifying!

324
00:23:18,520 --> 00:23:19,940
What?

325
00:23:19,940 --> 00:23:20,940
What are you talking about, you guys?!

326
00:23:21,940 --> 00:23:22,940
What is the meaning of this?

327
00:23:22,940 --> 00:23:24,940
You can't possibly be scared of that fake exorcism!

328
00:23:24,940 --> 00:23:30,940
Umm... actually, we came here to resign from this job!

329
00:23:30,940 --> 00:23:34,940
We know Ryo-san is super enthusiastic, but we just can't keep up with him!

330
00:23:34,940 --> 00:23:37,940
His boot camp training is way too brutal!

331
00:23:37,940 --> 00:23:40,940
Wait... you mean you weren't haunting Ryotsu?

332
00:23:40,940 --> 00:23:44,940
No way! HE was haunting US!

333
00:23:44,940 --> 00:23:47,940
The real demonic monster of greed is that man!

334
00:23:47,940 --> 00:23:51,940
WHAT?! What about the 1,225,000 yen I borrowed and sank into this?!

335
00:23:51,940 --> 00:23:53,940
I'm not letting you quit now!

336
00:23:56,940 --> 00:23:58,940
Get back here!

337
00:23:58,940 --> 00:24:04,360
Wait, Ryotsu! RYOTSUUU!!

338
00:24:04,360 --> 00:24:11,360
The gorgeous Corvette driver I hit on along the Shuto Expressway
turned out to be Maria's mom?!

339
00:24:11,360 --> 00:24:14,360
Wait, that means she's Chief Honda's wife?!

340
00:24:14,360 --> 00:24:18,360
The ward office might forgive this,
but Kankichi Ryotsu will never allow it!

341
00:24:18,360 --> 00:24:22,360
Next time: 'The Gorgeous Wife Is Super Extreme!' Look forward to it!

342
00:24:39,850 --> 00:24:53,720
Thank you for watching!

